### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:1337/api

### 1. GET - Lister tous les skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills

### 2. GET - Récupérer skill by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills/1

### 3. POST - Créer un nouveau skill
POST {{baseUrl}}/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "Angular"
  }
}

### 4. POST - Test contrainte UNIQUE (créer même nom - doit échouer 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "React"
  }
}

### 5. PUT - Modifier skill ID 1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/skills/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "React 18"
  }
}

### 6. DELETE - Supprimer skill ID 2
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/skills/2

### 7. GET - Vérifier après suppression
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills
